# Concept Page Template

Concept pages explain abstract ideas, theories, and frameworks.

## Frontmatter

```yaml
---
type: concept
title: "Concept Name"
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
tags: [tag1, tag2, tag3]
aliases: ["Alternative Term", "Synonym"]
category: theory | methodology | framework | principle
---
```

## Body Structure

```markdown
# Concept Name

## Definition

Clear, concise definition of the concept (1-2 paragraphs).

## Explanation

Detailed explanation including:
- Origins and history
- Core principles
- Key components or aspects
- How it works in practice

## Examples

### Example 1
Description of concrete instance demonstrating the concept.

### Example 2
Another illustrative case.

## Related Concepts

- [[concept-004|Parent Concept]] - Broader category
- [[concept-005|Related Concept]] - Similar or contrasting idea
- [[concept-006|Prerequisite Concept]] - Foundation knowledge

## Sources Discussing This Concept

- [[source-003|Primary Source]] - Original articulation
- [[source-004|Secondary Source]] - Application or critique

## Applications

- Field 1: How concept applies
- Field 2: Another application domain
```

